# Booking Receipt — XPath & FMS_BR_001–005

Full catalog: `ruleAi.md` Section 5.13–5.14.

## Delete flow (FMS_BR_005)

1. `open_list_page()` → `refresh_list_page()`
2. `delete_booking_receipt_from_grid(booking_no, "Delete Booking Receipt Success!")`
3. `open_list_page()` → `wait_until_booking_absent(booking_no)`

Shared `booking_no` from FMS_BR_002: `TestEfmsBookingReceipt.booking_no`.

## XPath — copy into POM only (never in tests)

**Toolbar Delete (use this):**
```
xpath=//*[contains(@class,'m-portlet__head')]
  //button[contains(@class,'btn-outline-danger') and .//i[contains(@class,'la-trash')]]
```

**Delete popup title:**
```
xpath=//h5[text()='Delete Booking Receipt ']//ancestor::div
```

**Yes on delete popup:**
```
xpath=//h5[text()='Delete Booking Receipt ']//ancestor::div//span[text()=' Yes ']
```

**Row checkbox `{booking_no}`:**
```
xpath=//tr[.//span[normalize-space()='{booking_no}']]//input[@type='checkbox']
```

**Row verify absent (exact match):**
```
xpath=//table//tbody//tr[.//span[normalize-space()='{booking_no}']
  or .//a[normalize-space()='{booking_no}']]
```

**Row delete — reference only, do NOT click in automation:**
```
xpath=//tr[.//span[normalize-space()='{booking_no}']]
  //app-permission-button[@type='delete']
```

**Loading overlay:**
```
.m-blockui | .block-ui-wrapper.block-ui-active | .loading-mask
```

## Debug class

`TestEfmsBookingReceiptDeleteDebug` — `EFMS_DEBUG_BOOKING_NO` env or `BOOKING_NO` constant.
